SYNONYMS
prasāde—on achievement of the causeless mercy of the Lord; sarva—of all;
duḥkhānām—material miseries; hāniḥ—destruction; asya—his;
upajāyate—takes place; prasanna-cetasaḥ—of the happy-minded;
