TRANSLATION
They believe that to gratify the senses is the prime necessity of human
civilization. Thus until the end of life their anxiety is immeasurable. Bound by
a network of hundreds of thousands of desires and absorbed in lust and anger,
they secure money by illegal means for sense gratification.

